==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 1.67 seconds<sup>50f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*2 [[Swordsman (form 2) (Enemy)|Swordsmen (form 2)]] spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Gekirinchi (Enemy)|Gekirinchi]] spawns as the boss.
**4 [[LeMurr]]s spawn, delay 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
**3 [[Swordsman (form 2) (Enemy)|Swordsmen (form 2)]] spawn, delay 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win. A lot of units can outrange Gekirinchii, such as [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]], [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]] and even [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Sexy Legs Cat]].

